{
  "$comment": "Directorios y listados de ToolSnap MCP. Fuente de verdad humana: tabla «Tabla de listados e integraciones» de la nota 11 del vault. Este fichero dice QUÉ comprobar en cada fila; lo ejecuta scripts/listings-check.mts y lo usa la skill toolsnap-listings-review. `match` es un trozo único de la primera celda de la fila. `cadence`: weekly = cosas que se mueven (PRs, issues, reclamaciones); monthly = fichas con cifras. Placeholders en `expect`: {version} (server.json), {skill_version} (skills/toolsnap/SKILL.md), {total} (tools en /.well-known/mcp.json), {repo}.",
  "repo": "ToolSnap-app/toolsnap-mcp",
  "old_repo": "icosaedro-git/toolsnap-mcp",
  "listings": [
    {
      "id": "official-registry",
      "match": "Official MCP Registry",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "owner": "claude",
      "checks": [{ "type": "registry", "name": "app.toolsnap/toolsnap-mcp" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "glama-server",
      "match": "servers/ToolSnap-app/toolsnap-mcp",
      "cadence": "monthly",
      "owner": "claude",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "page",
          "url": "https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/ToolSnap-app/toolsnap-mcp",
          "tools": true,
          "repo": true,
          "absent": ["first call free"],
          "capture": { "score": "(\\d{2,3})\\s*%" }
        }
      ],
      "unai_todo": "Glama: si el build de prueba sale verde, pulsar «Build & Release» en /admin/dockerfile (login de Glama)"
    },
    {
      "id": "glama-connector",
      "match": "Glama connector",
      "cadence": "monthly",
      "owner": "claude",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "page",
          "url": "https://glama.ai/mcp/connectors/app.toolsnap/toolsnap-mcp",
          "tools": true,
          "repo": true,
          "contains": ["Ownership verified"],
          "capture": { "status": "Status\\s+(\\w+)", "tdqs": "TDQS\\s+([A-F][+-]?)" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pulsemcp",
      "match": "PulseMCP",
      "cadence": "monthly",
      "owner": "claude",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "page",
          "url": "https://www.pulsemcp.com/servers/toolsnap",
          "tools": true,
          "repo": true,
          "browser_fallback": "PulseMCP devuelve 403 a ToolSnap y a curl; abrir en el navegador integrado y leer la cifra de tools"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "startupscores",
      "match": "StartupScores",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "owner": "claude",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "page",
          "url": "https://startupscores.com/startup/toolsnap-mcp",
          "repo": true,
          "capture": { "score": "Current score\\s+(\\d+)", "rank": "Global rank\\s+#?(\\d+)" }
        },
        {
          "type": "page",
          "url": "https://mcp.toolsnap.app/ywm_J6KVlJWJC9SIIZduQUSkUXlzx1cWFs19o4GYqkM.txt",
          "via": "local",
          "label": "fichero de prueba de dominio (no borrar)"
